id=usb_volume_fix_v2
name=Wired Earphone Volume Fix v2
version=2.1
versionCode=3
author=sensenova
description=Fixes USB DAC earphone volume. Watchdog starts daemon only on USB connect, stops on disconnect. Sets USB hardware volume via tinymix (card 1) only. Does not touch persist.audio props, spllimit, audio HAL, or speaker.
